  english: These ships will attack your Fortress directly. They will dock at the
    shore or crash into the spike traps. When a ship is destroyed, enemy soldiers
    will spawn.
  vietnamese: "Nh\u1EEFng thuy\u1EC1n n\xE0y s\u1EBD t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp
